      "widgets_values": [
        "hand-painted 2D Japanese anime, cinematic cel shading, clean line art, consistent character design, detailed atmospheric background. Aya, a 16-year-old girl with short black hair, a red scarf and brown wool coat, is fully visible and unobstructed on the left side of a floating lantern tower's spiral stairwell at deep indigo dusk. She climbs two steps as her scarf billows in the wind and warm amber lantern light flickers. The sea of clouds drifts below. A slow stable push-in preserves her appearance and the background throughout the shot."
